{"acceptance":"A cleanup criteria doc exists under docs/research/ and includes delete/archive/keep criteria, required evidence types, and rollback expectations.","created_at":"2026-04-30T15:31:47.162165658Z","description":"Define objective criteria for what may be deleted or archived before the rename. Cleanup must be evidence-driven: no imports, no active docs references, no CLI path, no generated asset dependency, or explicit duplicate supersession.","id":"agent-235efb9a","issue_type":"task","labels":["area:rename","kind:cleanup","phase:pre-rename"],"notes":"Prework review before execution: bead is complete and testable. Scope is doc-only cleanup criteria under docs/research; acceptance is deterministic by inspecting for delete/archive/keep criteria, required evidence types, and rollback expectations. Improvement for implementer: make the criteria immediately useful to later CL inventory beads by including a checklist/table template and explicit non-delete categories for historical HELIX/changelog artifacts.","parent":"agent-996dca04","priority":1,"status":"open","title":"CL-001 Define dead/duplicative cleanup criteria","updated_at":"2026-04-30T15:40:35.187848749Z"}
